<LanguageData>
  <!--EN: A gelatinized cube of Go-Juice, able to be digested rather than injected. While it can be used in any meal, it is often melted into soups or used as a thickening agent in cocktails. Provides a very diluted version of the drug without risk of addictions.-->
  <VBE_GoJuiceStock.description>活力水做成胶状块，能被快速消化。经常被用来融进汤食或稠化鸡尾酒。浓度极低，没有成瘾性。</VBE_GoJuiceStock.description>
  <!--EN: go-juice stock-->
  <VBE_GoJuiceStock.label>活力冻</VBE_GoJuiceStock.label>
  <!--EN: A very finely blended powder made from luciferium. Usually put around rims of alcoholic drinks in bars frequented by the wealthy and powerful. Provides a very diluted version of the drug without risk of addictions.-->
  <VBE_LuciferiumPowder.description>从魔鬼素中提炼的粉，经常被富人用来装点酒饮。浓度极低，没有成瘾性。</VBE_LuciferiumPowder.description>
  <!--EN: luciferium powder-->
  <VBE_LuciferiumPowder.label>魔鬼素粉</VBE_LuciferiumPowder.label>
  <!--EN: A crushed and powdered form of wake-up, surprisingly sweet and sometimes used as a replacement for sugar in desserts or dissolved into a morning espresso. Provides a very diluted version of the drug without risk of addictions.-->
  <VBE_WakeUpPowder.description>清醒丸打成的粉，非常甜，可以作为砂糖使用。浓度极低，没有成瘾性。</VBE_WakeUpPowder.description>
  <!--EN: wake-up powder-->
  <VBE_WakeUpPowder.label>清醒粉</VBE_WakeUpPowder.label>
</LanguageData>
